<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #0c0e12; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #f6f6fc; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #171a1f; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #46484d; }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #d97706); padding: 40px 40px 30px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 900; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -1px; }
        .header p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
        .body { padding: 40px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #f59e0b; }
        .text { color: #aaabb0; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        th { text-align: left; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #74757a; padding: 8px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #46484d; }
        td { padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2d33; font-size: 14px; color: #f6f6fc; vertical-align: top; }
        tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
        td .sub { color: #aaabb0; font-size: 12px; }
        .badge { display: inline-block; background-color: #f59e0b; color: #0c0e12; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 24px 40px; border-top: 1px solid #46484d; }
        .footer p { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #74757a; }
        .footer strong { color: #69daff; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>KINETIC PULSE</h1>
            <p>📋 Alertes expirations d'abonnements — {{ gym.name }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
            <p class="greeting">Bonjour {{ gym.gymOwner.name }} 👋</p>
            <p class="text">
                Voici les abonnements de votre salle <strong>{{ gym.name }}</strong> qui arrivent à expiration
                dans les prochains jours. Pensez à contacter les membres concernés pour renouveler leur abonnement.
            </p>

            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Membre</th>
                        <th>Type</th>
                        <th>Expire le</th>
                        <th>Jours restants</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {% for item in items %}
                    <tr>
                        <td>
                            <strong>{{ item.subscription.client.firstName }} {{ item.subscription.client.lastName }}</strong>
                            <div class="sub">{{ item.subscription.client.email }}</div>
                        </td>
                        <td>{{ item.subscription.subscriptionType.name }}</td>
                        <td>{{ item.subscription.endDate|date('d/m/Y') }}</td>
                        <td><span class="badge">{{ item.daysLeft }} jour{{ item.daysLeft > 1 ? 's' : '' }}</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <p class="text">
                Rendez-vous sur votre tableau de bord Kinetic Pulse pour gérer les abonnements de vos membres. 💪
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>© 2026 <strong>Kinetic Pulse</strong> · Cotonou, Bénin</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement, merci de ne pas y répondre.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
